Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 21:12:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Align library /runtime proxies with aziel-runtime pull APIs.

Proxy and fall back GET /runtime/v1/bundle (compact listing) and
GET /runtime/v1/pull/{slug}/skill so an AI can start from
azielcorpuslibrary.net/runtime and match the Worker pull+invoke root.
---
